  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00991-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row17Member">当社グループの原材料仕入等の取引先であり、同社との取引関係の維持・強化のため保有しております。また、当社は議決権の行使を指図する権限を有しております。</jpcrp030000-asr_E00991-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
